Courier artwork
----------------

The courier artwork in these files is an AI-assisted adaptation inspired by
the Go Gopher:

  branding/logo.png
  branding/readme-banner.webp
  build/appicon.png
  build/windows/icon.ico

The original Go Gopher was created by Renee French.

Source: https://go.dev/blog/gopher
License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
License URL: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The adaptation changes the pose, colors, clothing, accessories, and setting to
depict a mail courier. It is distributed under CC BY 4.0.

